              "type": "string",
              "description": "An optional high-level hint to guide downstream extraction filters. Best practices: use 'CODE_BOILERPLATE' when looking for configuration scripts or programming implementations, or 'VERBATIM_STATUTE' when retrieving specific clauses, regulations, legal provisions, or licensing text."
            },
