  "overviewMarkdown": "### Natural Language Grounded Search 🧭\n\nAn intelligent, multi-stage retrieval and evidence reconciliation engine powered by an internal Gemini pipeline.\n\n#### Architecture:\n1. **Gemini 3.5 Flash-Lite Routing:** Classifies incoming natural language research objectives into specialized retrieval lanes (code extraction, forum troubleshooting, contradiction auditing, tradeoff mapping, statutory/verbatim extraction, enumeration, and procedures) and plans targeted search queries.\n2. **Parallel Dual-Branch Search:** Gathers primary evidence alongside adversarial/counter-evidence tracks for balanced coverage.\n3. **Signal Extraction & Window Scoring:** Isolates high-value code blocks, troubleshooting workarounds, and step-by-step procedures while filtering noise.\n4. **Epistemic Integrity Auditing (SIFT):** Performs credibility audits evaluating publisher lateral reputation, consensus coherence, provenance, rhetorical tone, and funding bias.\n5. **Citation Graph & Echo-Chamber Detection:** Identifies circular citations and single-primary dependency across secondary sources.\n6. **Gemini 3.5 Flash-Lite Evidence Reconciliation:** Synthesizes verified artifacts, grounded claims with lineage, and meta-analytical control guidance.\n\n#### Configuration:\n- **Unified Proxy URL:** Optional base URL for Cloudflare proxy to bypass CORS in browser environments.\n- **Search Engine API Key:** API key for the underlying web search service.\n- **Google Gemini API Key:** API key used for Gemini 3.5 Flash-Lite calls via the Interactions API.\n- **Action on Search API Error:** Choose whether upstream API errors throw an immediate UI popup or return structured diagnostics to the model.",
